  "content": "\n    <h3 id=\"perl-guides\">Perl Guides</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Getting started with Perl (Win) (<a href=\"../../resources/gettingperlstarted/index.html\">PDF</a>)</li>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.perl.org/\"  aria-label=\"Perl Guide (opens in a new tab)\"  >Perl Guide</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n    <h3 id=\"tutorials\">Tutorials</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://web.ornl.gov/sci/techresources/Human_Genome/publicat/primer2001/primer.pdf\"  aria-label=\"Primer on molecular biology (PDF) (opens in a new tab)\"  >Primer on molecular biology (PDF)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n    <h3 id=\"other-resources\">Other Resources</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://arep.med.harvard.edu/compubio.html\"  aria-label=\"Harvard/MIT Computational Biology Studies (opens in a new tab)\"  >Harvard/MIT Computational Biology Studies</a></li>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.hms.harvard.edu/dms/bbs/\"  aria-label=\"Program in Biological and Biomedical Sciences (BBS) (opens in a new tab)\"  >Program in Biological and Biomedical Sciences (BBS)</a></li>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://hst.mit.edu/\"  aria-label=\"Harvard-MIT Division of Health Sciences and Technology (HST) (opens in a new tab)\"  >Harvard-MIT Division of Health Sciences and Technology (HST)</a></li>\n<li><a   class=\"external-link \"   target=\"_blank\"   href=\"http://www.wiley.com/legacy/products/subject/life/bioinformatics/courses.html\"  aria-label=\"Nationwide list of Bioinformatics courses (opens in a new tab)\"  >Nationwide list of Bioinformatics courses</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
